  "definition": "ADP Requirements for Organizational Changes",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-06-02",
  "historyNote": "#5517, eff 11-25-92; ss by #6895, INTERIM, eff 11-26-98, EXPIRED: 3-26-99 New. #9106, eff 3-18-08; ss by #9565, eff 10-16-09; ss by #12198, eff 6-2-17",
